Flying through the entire galaxy, passing through the Kuiper Belt, and reaching the heart of the Oort Cloud, Cupid's arrow brings the celebration of love. According to preliminary calculations, the magical effect will disappear on the morning of February 19.
Properties of the magical effect:

- Making payments through the WebMoney & Xsolla payment system will grant you +100% deuterium for free! Promotional deuterium packages are also available in "Special Offers." If you encounter difficulties in purchasing deuterium or lack WebMoney, you can always contact the game's official dealer with the in-game nickname DEALER.
- Now you can gift a present to any Lord for just 1 deuterium;
- Festive mission;
- 75% discount on skill reset and captain dismissal;
- The cost of all Global premium services is reduced by 50% (except premium ships).
- 33% discount on Science activation;
- 40% discount on the Shop assortment.

Wishing you love, joy, and warmth of the heart!

Dear Lords!

Astro Lords team wishes you a Merry Christmas and Happy New Year.

We wish the New Year 2024 to bring you unforgettable emotions, pleasant and warm meetings, significant achievements, as well as welcome gifts!

From 12/28/2023 to 01/07/2024, a number of pleasant events await you: discounts, tasks and other gifts!

1. Making payments you will receive + 100% deuterium for free!

2. Surprises can drop only a gold or bronze artifact.
The chance of dropping a golden artifact is 50%.
When you open a surprise, only one artifact drops out.
Added all bronze and gold artifacts except for unique artifacts and those sold for tritium.
The opening price of the surprise is 4000 deuterium.

3. The most warming discounts:
75% reset of skills and dismissal of captains;
33% purchase of the entire assortment of the Store;
33% all premium Asteroids;
75% Discount on the transition from 25 Starbase to 26;
30% change of the Faction and the creation of the Clan;
33% price of activation of all Sciences;
30% discount on the construction of level 10 factories.

