The Astro Lords team congratulates you on the upcoming Christmas and New Year holidays.
We wish the New Year 2020 bring you unforgettable emotions, pleasant and warm meetings, significant achievements, as well as desired gifts![/i]

[u]From 12/27/2019 to 01/07/2020 inclusive, a number of pleasant events await you: discounts, tasks and other gifts![/u]

